        ex:hasText "Given The client requirements, I would recommend an approach that leverages our expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT projects. our have led 8 consortia and have experience with partner management, which could be beneficial in integrating an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents into existing practices. our typical delivery structure includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot/MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support, which can help ensure a smooth implementation." ;
