    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will be hosted on a sovereign infrastructure certified to the SecNumCloud type or equivalent within the EU, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. a cloud-based architecture will consist of the following components: - A containerized application using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) for scalability and high availability. - Integration with existing systems through APIs, using our experience with API gateways like Kong and Apigee. - A data engineering layer to ensure seamless data flow between systems, utilizing our expertise in data processing and storage. - An AI/ML module to provide intelligent assistance, leveraging our experience with LLM models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3, CamemBERT, and Falcon, as well as RAG frameworks like LangChain, LlamaIndex, and Haystack. - A cybersecurity layer to ensure the protection of sensitive data, using our knowledge of security design patterns, including Zero-trust, VLAN segmentation, mTLS between services, AES-256 at rest, and TLS 1.3 in transit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

