        ex:hasText "Lastly, as a company certified with ISO 27001 for the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, and experienced with GDPR compliance (having a DPO appointed and data subject rights implemented), we are well-positioned to handle the security and privacy requirements outlined in The tender. we existing certifications and experience demonstrate we commitment to data protection and information security, which will be essential in meeting the stringent GDPR compliance requirements specified." ;
