    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we standard contractual clauses sufficient to address these concerns? we must flag the risk of non-compliance with GDPR regulations, particularly given the client's requirement that no decision be automated without explicit validation by an authorized agent. we company context indicates that we have experience with GDPR compliance, as evidenced by we standard legal basis for data processing under Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR and we data protection addendum (DPA) template version 3.2." ;
